    "note": "Informational projection of the contract and receipt; only the statement and manifest are cryptographically bound.",
    "objective": "Make Sigstore verification work with current cosign (3.x): verify-blob-attestation no longer accepts --statement (Evidence signing run 44414500869: 'unknown flag: --statement'). The core Sigstore provider and the Evidence signing workflow verify with --type <predicateType> --digest <subject sha256> --digestAlg sha256 plus the identity and issuer policy, then require the signed DSSE payload to be exactly the statement. Continues abandoned task sigstore-verify-cosign3, whose frozen scope missed tests/sigstore.test.js and tests/signing-provider-conformance.test.js.",
